flowchart LR
  req[Requirements and invariants] --> lld[Low level design: classes and schema]
  lld --> base[Baseline: SQL only claim path]
  base --> bench1[Benchmark 1: 1M attempts]
  bench1 --> opt[Optimised: Redis gate + outbox + Kafka worker]
  opt --> recon[Reconciler and failure handling]
  recon --> bench2[Benchmark 2: 1M attempts]
  bench2 --> deploy[AWS deployment design]
  deploy --> report[Report and submission]
  bench1 -. numbers .-> report
  bench2 -. numbers .-> report
